{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52353","headline":"诗（幷序） 一一四 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 一一四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愚夫痴杌杌，常守无明窟。\n沉沦苦海中，出头还复没。\n顶戴神灵珠，随身无价物。\n二鼠数相侵，四蛇推（项校「摧」）命疾。\n似露草头霜，见日一代毕。\n更愚丸（项校「遇刀」，张改「遇炎」）风吹，彼此俱无匹。\n贮得满堂金，知是谁家物。\n（以上皆录自张锡厚《王梵志诗校辑》卷三，原卷爲伯三八三三、伯二九一四、苏一四八七、二八七一。\n该卷有五首已收入《全唐诗补逸》卷二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}